{"id":16782,"mal_id":16782,"title":"Kotonoha no Niwa","englishTitle":"The Garden of Words","title_english":"The Garden of Words","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Koto no Ha no Niwa","The Garden of Kotonoha"],"en":"The Garden of Words","ja":"言の葉の庭"},"synopsis":"On a rainy morning in Tokyo, Takao Akizuki, an aspiring shoemaker, decides to skip class to sketch designs in a beautiful garden. This is where he meets Yukari Yukino, a beautiful yet mysterious woman, for the very first time. Offering to make her new shoes, Takao continues to meet with Yukari throughout the rainy season, and without even realizing it, the two are able to alleviate the worries hidden in their hearts just by being with each other. However, their personal struggles have not disappeared completely, and as the end of the rainy season approaches, their relationship will be put to the test.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En una mañana lluviosa en Tokio, Takao Akizuki, un aspirante a zapatero, decide faltar a clases para dibujar diseños en un hermoso jardín. Aquí es donde conoce por primera vez a Yukari Yukino, una mujer hermosa pero misteriosa. Ofreciéndose a hacer sus zapatos nuevos, Takao continúa reuniéndose con Yukari durante la temporada de lluvias y, sin siquiera darse cuenta, los dos pueden aliviar las preocupaciones escondidas en sus corazones simplemente estando juntos. Sin embargo, sus luchas personales no han desaparecido por completo y, a medida que se acerca el final de la temporada de lluvias, su relación se pondrá a prueba.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"Movie","media_type":"movie","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":2760,"average_episode_duration":2760,"startDate":"2013-05-31","start_date":"2013-05-31","endDate":"2013-05-31","end_date":"2013-05-31","season":"spring","year":2013,"start_season":{"year":2013,"season":"spring"},"episodes":1,"num_episodes":1,"score":7.85,"mean":7.85,"numListUsers":946426,"num_list_users":946426,"genres":[{"id":